 5. **No namespace** → keep as-is.
 
 This runs on `parent_class`, `used_traits`, and `mixins` for every `ClassInfo` extracted from a file.
+
+### Open-buffer ownership during lazy class loading
+
+Lazy class parsing returns the current shared class records for an open URI.
+Its saved disk snapshot cannot replace didOpen/didChange state. The lazy path
+checks before parsing and again before publication; a read guard on open-file
+admission spans publication, so an overlapping didOpen either causes the disk
+result to be discarded or publishes its overlay after the disk result. This
+shares the existing class/index publisher and does not infer a second type.
